--
libstdc++ 13 <atomic>: std::atomic<int> is a conversion error, the root cause
being cpp11_using_declaration_conversion_function_member_typedef (`using
__base_type::operator __integral_type;').  The body of
__waiter_pool_base::_S_for (bits/atomic_wait.h:252) is dropped, the root
cause being cpp_functional_cast_through_typedef_reinterprets
(`uintptr_t(__addr)').  g++ 13 accepts this program, and it fails only its
WRONG assertion.
